      "widgets_values": [
        "SnapRef Region Mask - sample 1: left / right split (layout = left_right)\n\n1. Copy examples/input/snapref_region_mask_ref_A.png and _ref_B.png into ComfyUI/input.\n2. Set the UNET / CLIP / VAE / SnapRef adapter file names to yours (any Anima model).\n3. Queue. Reference A (image) is read only left of `split` (0.5),\n   reference B (image_2) only right of it. layout = top_bottom splits above / below instead,\n   layout = boxes uses x / y / width / height and x_2 ... height_2.\n\nBypass \"SnapRef Region Mask\" (Ctrl+B) to see both references mix on both girls.\n\nTips: keep SnapRef strength at 0, say in the prompt who is on which side,\nand add a short appearance description of each girl: it raises outfit fidelity."
      ],
